# Environment Configuration

## File contract

| File | Tracked? | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `.env.example` | ✅ committed | Template with **every** key the app reads. Placeholder values for secrets. |
| `.env.test` | ✅ committed | Used by tests + CI. Points at `*_test` services on isolated ports. **No real secrets** — generate locally only. |
| `.env` | ❌ ignored | Local override. Auto-copied from `.env.example` by `make setup ENV=local` if missing. |
| `.env.production` | ❌ ignored / does not exist | Production env vars come from Render's env var groups, not files. |

## Rules

- ❌ NEVER commit `.env`, `.env.local`, or any file containing real credentials.
- ❌ NEVER add a setting in `Settings` without also adding it to `.env.example`. CI runs `make check-env` and fails on drift.
- ❌ NEVER read env vars outside `app/core/config.py` — go through `Settings`.
- ❌ NEVER use a single `DATABASE_URL` for both dev and test. The two are **separate keys**, separate hosts/ports.
- ✅ Use `SecretStr` for every credential in `Settings` so it can't be `print`ed accidentally.
- ✅ Sort `.env.example` by section with comment headers (`# --- Database ---`, etc.).
- ✅ Document every setting in `.env.example` with a one-line comment above the key.

## Required keys (categories)

```
# --- App ---
APP_NAME=fastapi-boilerplate
APP_ENV=local                       # local | dev | staging | production | test
APP_VERSION=0.0.0
APP_DEBUG=false
APP_DOCS_ENABLED=true               # disable in production unless gated
APP_CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000"]
APP_TRUSTED_HOSTS=["*"]
APP_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30
APP_GRACEFUL_SHUTDOWN_SECONDS=30
SECRET_KEY=__change_me__

# --- Service role (production only) ---
SERVICE_ROLE=web                    # web | worker | beat

# --- Database (dev) ---
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://app:app@postgres:5432/app
DATABASE__POOL_SIZE=10
DATABASE__MAX_OVERFLOW=20

# --- Database (test) ---
DATABASE_URL_TEST=postgresql+asyncpg://app:app@postgres_test:5432/app_test

# --- Redis (dev / test) ---
REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0
REDIS_URL_TEST=redis://redis_test:6379/0

# --- Celery ---
CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://redis:6379/1
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://redis:6379/2
CELERY_BROKER_URL_TEST=redis://redis_test:6379/1
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND_TEST=redis://redis_test:6379/2
CELERY_WORKER_CONCURRENCY=4
CELERY_QUEUES=default,events
CELERY_BEAT_SCHEDULER=celery.beat.PersistentScheduler
CELERY_CRON_LOCK_PREFIX=cron:lock
CELERY_CRON_LOCK_TTL_SECONDS=300

# --- Email ---
EMAIL_ENABLED=true
EMAIL_PROVIDER=smtp                 # smtp | sendgrid | ses | postmark | null
EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=no-reply@example.com
EMAIL_FROM_NAME="FastAPI Boilerplate"
SMTP_HOST=mailhog
SMTP_PORT=1025
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASSWORD=
SMTP_USE_TLS=false
SMTP_USE_STARTTLS=false

# --- Auth / Security ---
AUTH_ENABLED=false
JWT_SECRET_KEY=__change_me__
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL_MINUTES=60
PASSWORD_MIN_LENGTH=12

# --- HTTP client ---
HTTP_CLIENT__TIMEOUT_SECONDS=10
HTTP_CLIENT__RETRY_ATTEMPTS=3
HTTP_CLIENT__RETRY_BACKOFF_BASE=0.2
HTTP_CLIENT__MAX_KEEPALIVE=50
HTTP_CLIENT__MAX_CONNECTIONS=200

# --- Observability ---
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOG_FORMAT=json                     # json | console
SENTRY_DSN=
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=
OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_ARG=0.1
METRICS_ENDPOINT_AUTH_TOKEN=

# --- Rate limit ---
RATE_LIMIT_DEFAULT=100/minute
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH=10/minute

# --- i18n / l10n (see i18n-l10n.mdc) ---
LOCALES_ENABLED=["en","ar"]              # JSON list of BCP-47 codes
LOCALE_DEFAULT=en
LOCALE_FALLBACK=en
LOCALE_QUERY_PARAM=lang                  # ?lang=ar override; "" disables this hop
LOCALE_HEADER_NAME=Accept-Language
LOCALE_DOMAIN=messages
LOCALE_DIR=app/locales
RTL_LOCALES=["ar"]
LOCALE_TRANSLATION_COMPLETENESS_MIN=0.95 # CI gate
```

## .env.test extras (mandatory)

```
APP_ENV=test
DATABASE_URL=${DATABASE_URL_TEST}
REDIS_URL=${REDIS_URL_TEST}
CELERY_BROKER_URL=${CELERY_BROKER_URL_TEST}
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=${CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND_TEST}
EMAIL_ENABLED=false                 # NullEmailSender
CELERY_TASK_ALWAYS_EAGER=true       # synchronous task execution in tests
SENTRY_DSN=
LOG_LEVEL=WARNING
LOG_FORMAT=console
```

## Production overrides (set in Render env var groups)

- `APP_ENV=production`
- `APP_DEBUG=false`
- `APP_DOCS_ENABLED=false` (or gated)
- `APP_CORS_ORIGINS` set to known domains (no wildcards).
- `APP_TRUSTED_HOSTS` set to deployed hostnames.
- `SECRET_KEY`, `JWT_SECRET_KEY` from Render `generateValue: true`.
- `DATABASE_URL`, `REDIS_URL` from managed addons.
- `SENTRY_DSN`, `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` set.
- `METRICS_ENDPOINT_AUTH_TOKEN` set.

## Drift detection

- `make check-env` parses `Settings` and the `.env.example` file; fails if any field is missing in the example or if the example contains stale keys.
- The same script runs in CI on every PR.
